// Motion graphics: a library of motion videos made with AI, sorted into topics (a video can sit in several), each with the prompt
// behind it. The catalog is the user's Prompt Motion project (their Manus build, `public/posts.json`): 233 posts, each crediting its
// creator and linking to the original post on X. The video, preview and poster files are NOT stored by us: they play from the host
// that project used (`media.prompt-motion.com`), so they can stop working if that host removes them, and the creators' permission to
// show them is the owner's responsibility. Prompts live in `motion-prompts.ts` (kept out of the feed's bundle). An id may only appear once;
// the post id (`xId`) is the number at the end of its x.com address.
export type MotionTag = "Product UI" | "Phone" | "Charts" | "Diagrams" | "Kinetic type" | "Shapes" | "Particles" | "Characters" | "Photos" | "Music" | "Code" | "Uncategorized";
